          "snippet": {
            "line": 1839,
            "text": "theorem zeroMean_axial (c : Context D) (u : State D) (hm : u.mean = ⟨0, 0, 0⟩) :\n    u.axialResidual c = c.operators.radialDiv 1 (u.covariance 0 2) +\n      c.operators.dz (u.covariance 2 2 + u.pressure) - c.operators.radialDiv 1 c.virtualAxial"
